{"page":335,"verses":[{"verse_key":"22:24","surah":22,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُدُوٓا۟ إِلَى ٱلطَّيِّبِ مِنَ ٱلْقَوْلِ وَهُدُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطِ ٱلْحَمِيدِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They were guided to good speech and to the path of the One Worthy of all Praise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُدُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And they were guided","transliteration":"wahudū","verse_key":"22:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"22:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلطَّيِّبِ","en_gloss":"the good","transliteration":"l-ṭayibi","verse_key":"22:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"22:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلِ","en_gloss":"the speech","transliteration":"l-qawli","verse_key":"22:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهُدُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and they were guided","transliteration":"wahudū","verse_key":"22:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"22:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"صِرَٰطِ","en_gloss":"(the) path","transliteration":"ṣirāṭi","verse_key":"22:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْحَمِيدِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Praiseworthy","transliteration":"l-ḥamīdi","verse_key":"22:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:24"}]},{"verse_key":"22:25","surah":22,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَيَصُدُّونَ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ وَٱلْمَسْجِدِ ٱلْحَرَامِ ٱلَّذِى جَعَلْنَـٰهُ لِلنَّاسِ سَوَآءً ٱلْعَـٰكِفُ فِيهِ وَٱلْبَادِ ۚ وَمَن يُرِدْ فِيهِ بِإِلْحَادٍۭ بِظُلْمٍ نُّذِقْهُ مِنْ عَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for the disbelievers, who bar others from God’s path and from the Sacred Mosque- which We made for all people, residents and visitors alike- and who try to violate it with wrongdoing, We shall make them taste a painful punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"22:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"22:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَر